      "description": "A health worker reads the client's history as their device shows it (an International Patient Summary, imported records, or a paper card and what the client reports) and takes into account what bears on today's care, weighing each item by where it came from: verified, unverified or reported. Input is the records with their provenance; output is what the health worker relies on.",
